<title>RUSSIA: Three coal miners killed in Russian Kuzbass region.</title>
<headline>Three coal miners killed in Russian Kuzbass region.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Russian miner was killed in an underground explosion and two others died in unrelated accidents on Tuesday, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
<p>Several miners were rushed to hospital with burns after the blast, which occurred at the Kalinin shaft in Siberia's Kuzbass coal-mining region. A commission is investigating the cause of the explosion, Tass said.</p>
<p>The two other miners, also working in the Kuzbass, died after safety standards were ignored, Tass said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
